{"5194540":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Primal Heir: The Mortal Realm","steam_appid":5194540,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[5216530],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Primal Heir: The Mortal Realm<\/strong> is a story-driven, nostalgic 2D JRPG built in the spirit of classic 16-bit console adventures.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the celestial <strong>Heart of Equilibrium<\/strong> shattered, its fragments rained upon the Mortal Realm, altering the fates of two chosen heirs.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow <strong>Kain<\/strong>, a warrior bound to shadow, and <strong>Eldora<\/strong>, a maiden tied to light, as their paths cross in a fracturing world. Explore vibrant towns, delve into dangerous dungeons, battle strange creatures, and uncover secrets hidden throughout the land.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Mortal Realm<\/strong> is the <strong>first installment<\/strong> in the larger Primal Heir story, concluding at Haven Port. The journey will continue in <strong>future chapters<\/strong>.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven retro JRPG adventure<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic party-based combat with old-school RPG mechanics<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A growing cast of playable companions<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handcrafted pixel-art environments<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Villages, forests, caves, ruins and ports to explore<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Side quests, secrets and optional activities<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment and crafting systems<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing and other world activities<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player adventure<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Primal Heir: The Mortal Realm<\/strong> is a story-driven, nostalgic 2D JRPG built in the spirit of classic 16-bit console adventures.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the celestial <strong>Heart of Equilibrium<\/strong> shattered, its fragments rained upon the Mortal Realm, altering the fates of two chosen heirs.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow <strong>Kain<\/strong>, a warrior bound to shadow, and <strong>Eldora<\/strong>, a maiden tied to light, as their paths cross in a fracturing world. Explore vibrant towns, delve into dangerous dungeons, battle strange creatures, and uncover secrets hidden throughout the land.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Mortal Realm<\/strong> is the <strong>first installment<\/strong> in the larger Primal Heir story, concluding at Haven Port. The journey will continue in <strong>future chapters<\/strong>.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven retro JRPG adventure<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic party-based combat with old-school RPG mechanics<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A growing cast of playable companions<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handcrafted pixel-art environments<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Villages, forests, caves, ruins and ports to explore<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Side quests, secrets and optional activities<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment and crafting systems<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing and other world activities<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player adventure<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"A story-driven retro JRPG where you build a party, explore a fantasy world, fight in classic turn-based battles, complete side quests, craft equipment, and uncover the legacy of the Primal Heir in a handcrafted pixel-art adventure.","supported_languages":"English","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5194540\/cff17e6acaea8528b7111a6913a2fd55c840ccfa\/header.jpg?t=1793650918","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5194540\/a6ce17fa6fb1a6f5d449dadbf49f5b15072ccd26\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793650918","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5194540\/a6ce17fa6fb1a6f5d449dadbf49f5b15072ccd26\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793650918","website":"https:\/\/animus.dx.am\/primal-heir.php","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3 or equivalent<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> DirectX 11 compatible graphics<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> DirectX compatible<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10\/11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5 or equivalent<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> DirectX 11 compatible graphics with 1 GB VRAM<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> DirectX compatible<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Requir